sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee as 👨‍💼 Faculty / Employee
    actor Manager as 👔 Department HOD / HR
    participant Portal as 💻 HR Portal
    participant LeaveService as 🌴 Leave Management Service
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Employee->>Portal: Checks Remaining Leave Quota
    Portal->>LeaveService: GET /api/v1/leaves/balances
    LeaveService->>DB: Query LeaveBalance (Annual: 15 left, Sick: 8 left)
    DB-->>Portal: Render available balances

    Employee->>Portal: Submits Leave Request (e.g. 3 days Annual Leave)
    Portal->>LeaveService: POST /api/v1/leaves/requests { leaveTypeId, startDate, endDate, reason }
    
    LeaveService->>DB: Validate days <= remainingDays
    alt Insufficient Quota
        LeaveService-->>Portal: 422 Error: Requested days exceed remaining quota
        Portal-->>Employee: Show Error: "Insufficient leave balance"
    else Quota Available
        LeaveService->>DB: Create LeaveRequest (status = PENDING)
        LeaveService-->>Manager: In-App & Email Notification: "New Leave Request"
        LeaveService-->>Employee: Request Submitted Successfully

        Manager->>Portal: Reviews Leave Request
        alt Rejected
            Manager->>Portal: Rejects with Reason
            Portal->>LeaveService: PATCH /api/v1/leaves/requests/:id/approve { status: REJECTED, rejectionReason }
            LeaveService->>DB: Update LeaveRequest status = REJECTED
            LeaveService-->>Employee: Notification: "Leave Request Rejected"
        else Approved
            Manager->>Portal: Approves Request
            Portal->>LeaveService: PATCH /api/v1/leaves/requests/:id/approve { status: APPROVED }
            LeaveService->>DB: Atomic Tx [Update status = APPROVED, increment usedDays, decrement remainingDays]
            LeaveService-->>Employee: Notification: "Leave Request Approved"
        end
    end
